      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Тем более, вы должны мне пятнадцать тысяч.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Десять.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Timur chooses sides, and the chef's debt is the reason. If you ever need to say 'you owe me', you've just heard it. Until the next scene.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
